  "description": "Merged 7 ibm security advisories published on 2026-07-24. Original advisory IDs: IBM-7281067, IBM-7281107, IBM-7281173, IBM-7281117, IBM-7281116, IBM-7281115, IBM-7281118\n\nTitles:\n- Multiple vulnerabilities found in IBM ApplinX.\n- Platform Navigator and Automation Assets in IBM Cloud Pak for Integration are vulnerable to multiple vulnerabilitie\n- Multiple Vulnerabilities in IBM Operator for PostgreSQL\n- IBM Security SOAR is using a component with a known vulnerability  (CVE-2026-44486, CVE-2026-44487, CVE-2026-44488, CVE-2026-44489, CVE-2026-44490, CVE-2026-44492, CVE-2026-44494, CVE-2026-44496)\n- IBM Security SOAR is using a component with a known vulnerability  (CVE-2026-22016, CVE-2026-22021, CVE-2026-22013, CVE-2026-22018)\n- SOAR App Host is using a component with known vulnerabilities   (CVE-2026-22016, CVE-2026-22021, CVE-2026-22013, CVE-2026-22018)\n- IBM Security SOAR is using a component with a known vulnerability  (CVE-2026-12143)",
